  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.2.0 names code built elsewhere. Coverage tools instrument dependencies that ship a PDB and report them under SourceLink paths (/_/src/...); their lines count toward every rate.\nNew ExternalSources warning names them (CLI stderr, JSON warnings, Fallout log) unless the report declares /_/ as its own source root.\nNew --exclude-external (Fallout: --coverage-exclude-external-param, library: ExclusionRules.External) removes them like the other exclusions.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.2.0.md",
